OL,4,BCulture, defence, Fernandes -          
OL,5,BPochettino's priorities at Man Utd     
OL,6,G"We have to find a way to create the   
OL,7,Gbest habits and culture that makes us  
OL,8,Gclose to winning every single game."   
OL,10,FMauricio Pochettino has used his first 
OL,11,Finterview as Manchester United head    
OL,12,Fcoach to outline his vision for the    
OL,13,Fclub.                                  
OL,15,FThe former Tottenham, Paris St-Germain 
OL,16,Fand Chelsea boss wasted no time        
OL,17,Fgetting across the Atlantic Ocean      
OL,18,Fafter completing his stint in charge   
OL,19,Fof the United States on Tuesday.       
